\u00a0biology courses have you taken, including any in which you a...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID128","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Approximately how many&nbsp;college-level&nbsp;<em><strong>biology<\/strong><\/em> courses have you taken, including any in which you are currently enrolled?&nbsp;"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4ORlgNIr9YWVxxc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID129","SecondaryAttribute":"Have you declared or are you planning to declare a major in biology or another life science?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Have you declared or are you planning to declare a major in biology or another life science?","DataExportTag":"D.9","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Have you declared or are you planning to declare a major in biology or another life science?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID129","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Have you declared or are you planning to declare a major in biology or another life science?"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4ORlgNIr9YWVxxc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID130","SecondaryAttribute":"Please check the subdiscipline(s) of biology in which you have taken the most courses","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Please check the subdiscipline(s) of biology in which you\nhave taken the most courses<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DataExportTag":"D.10","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Please check the subdiscipline(s) of biology in which you have taken the most courses","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Biochemistry"},"2":{"Display":"Physiology"},"3":{"Display":"Neuroscience"},"4":{"Display":"No specialization\/equal exposure"},"5":{"Display":"Ecology"},"7":{"Display":"Molecular\/Cell Biology"},"8":{"Display":"Evolution"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","7","2","3","5","8","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID130","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please check the subdiscipline(s) of biology in which you\nhave taken the most courses<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4ORlgNIr9YWVxxc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID131","SecondaryAttribute":"What is your approximate current overall G.P.A.?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>What is your approximate current overall G.P.A.?<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DataExportTag":"D.11","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"What is your approximate current overall G.P.A.?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0.0 - 0.69 (E or F)"},"2":{"Display":"0.7 - 1.69 (D- to D+)"},"3":{"Display":"1.7 - 2.69 (C- to C+)"},"4":{"Display":"2.7 - 3.69 (B- to B+)"},"5":{"Display":"3.7 - 4.00 (A- to A+)"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID131","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>What is your approximate current overall G.P.A.?<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4ORlgNIr9YWVxxc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID132","SecondaryAttribute":"Gender:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Gender:","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"D.12","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Gender:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Female"},"2":{"Display":"Male"},"3":{"Display":"Self-describe:","TextEntry":"true"},"4":{"Display":"Prefer not to disclose"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"